	"lots": {
		"note": "How blocks (the land left between roads, water and parks) are cut into building lots. sidewalk = gap between a road's edge and any lot (m). A block is split across its long side until each lot is at most max_area (m2) and at least min_width wide; split_jitter moves each cut a little off-centre (seeded, so the same JSON always gives the same lots). Pieces smaller than min_lot_area or shallower than min_depth are dropped. max_slope = steepest allowed ground under a lot.",
